      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Gaussian (bell-curve) random\n\n`random/gaussian` clusters samples around `mean` with standard deviation `sd`. Unlike Uniform (flat), most samples land near the mean — perfect for \"natural\" scatter.\n\n200 dots placed with mean=0, sd=80. See the cluster in the centre.",
        "width": 440,
        "height": 220
      },
      "portValues": {
